  "readableHtml": "\n<div><p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"http://www.wanmei.com/top/topw2i.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://www.wanmei.com/top/topw2i.htm</a></p></div>\n\n<div>\n\t<div>\n\t\t<p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200903/jl/iframe/header.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200903/jl/iframe/header.htm</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\t<div>\n\t\t<p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200903/jl/iframe/left.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://event51.wanmei.com/w2i/200903/jl/iframe/left.htm</a></p>\t\t\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#page=261a842e117a8e468d05\"><img src=\"assets/b0404348d056df492827.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<img src=\"assets/4425097046f4413d891a.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div><img src=\"assets/7461645b6ce10593d3a6.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n                <p><strong>元素精灵的装备都有什么？</strong></p>\n                <p>　　玩家可在各大主城的新NPC“五行地巡使”处购得元素精灵装备。</p>\n                <p>　　元素精灵的装备分为灵玉、灵镜、灵珠、灵符，每种各对应一个专属装备栏，元素精灵的装备一旦装上就无法拿下来，只能选择销毁或替换新的装备。</p>\n                <p>　　销毁或替换装备时需在各大主城的新NPC“五行地巡使”处进行。</p>\n                <p>　　</p>\n                <table>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><p>类型 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>名称 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>等级限制 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>属性 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>价格 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td rowspan=\"2\"><p>灵玉 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>无亥玉 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵29 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>灵力+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>1000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><p>引雷石 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵69 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>力量+1 灵力+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>3000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td rowspan=\"2\"><p>灵符 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>血纹符 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵9 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>力量+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>1000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><p>仙影符 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵49 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>力量+1 敏捷+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>3000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td rowspan=\"2\"><p>灵镜 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>阴阳镜 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵19 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>敏捷+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>1000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><p>冰盘镜 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵59 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>灵力+1 体质+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>3000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td rowspan=\"2\"><p>灵珠 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>九洗珠 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵39 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>体质+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>1000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td><p>澈影珠 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>元素精灵79 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>力量+1 体质+1 </p></td>\n                    <td><p>3000000 </p></td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n                <p>　　</p>\n                <p>　　玩家打开元素精灵的操作界面后即可看到装备栏</p>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"assets/ab73de155412c69702fc.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n                <p>　　</p>\n                <p>　　与新NPC“五行地巡使”对话，选择元素精灵拆卸装备，即可进入装备拆卸界面。</p>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"assets/68ffdee19fa05425aa48.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n  </tr>\n</table> \n                \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t  <div><img src=\"assets/cde6f4d3e8bb0e15596b.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<img src=\"assets/68cb742bb426a8f38c40.jpg\" alt=\"官方原始图片，未自动识读\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div></div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div><p class=\"source-reference\">嵌入资源：<a href=\"http://www.wanmei.com/top/down.htm\" rel=\"noreferrer\">http://www.wanmei.com/top/down.htm</a></p></div>\n\n<div>\n \n\n</div>\n",
